  "description": "Automatic audit trail tracking for Entity Framework Core 8+ with configurable property transformations, composite key support, manual bulk auditing, transaction-aware publishing, and row-level security permissions. Tracks entity changes via EF Core interceptors with extensible consumer pattern.",
  "iconFile": "pandatech.png",
